cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository, please cite it as below. This is an independent
  replication and extension of one finding in "Testing Black-White Disparities
  in Biological Aging Among Older Adults in the United States: Analysis of
  DNA-Methylation and Blood-Chemistry Methods" (Graf et al., American Journal
  of Epidemiology, 2022, https://doi.org/10.1093/aje/kwab281) -- to cite the
  original findings, cite that paper directly instead (see README for details).
title: >-
  BloodVsMethylation: Why Blood-Chemistry and Epigenetic PhenoAge Disagree About
  the Black-White Gap in Biological Aging
authors:
  - family-names: Gauran
    given-names: Iris Ivy
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/gauranii/BloodVsMethylation"
